 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/08/22 07:48| 01 | 340| 014| 0356| 0143| 0242| 0578|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/08/22 07:24| 02 | 270| 014| 0746| 0534| 0434| 1689|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/08/22 03:24| 01 | 066| 010| 0385| 0033| 0376| 0440|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/08/21 17:24| 03 | 338| 018| 0726| 0277| 0231| 1007|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/08/21 12:00| 01 | 036| 006| 0471| 0574| 0205| 1562|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/08/21 11:24| 02 | 288| 026| 031"
